{"seq":2,"slug":"game-applications","title":"应用（围棋残局/谜题）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/practice/game-applications","wordCount":1280,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用-围棋残局-谜题\">应用（围棋残局/谜题）</h1><p>前面所有理论都是为了这一刻：拿一个真实游戏，拆开、赋值、算出谁赢、赢多少。这一篇是纯粹的实战演练场，把 Nim、Grundy、超现实数、温度这些工具轮番用在一批经典游戏上——从围棋官子到 Domineering，从 Wythoff 到 Dots-and-Boxes。每个案例都对应前几章的一件武器，看它们如何在棋盘上真正开火。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CGT 分析一个游戏的通用流程是&quot;分解—赋值—合成&quot;：把复杂局面拆成互不干扰的独立分量，给每个分量算 CGT 值（公平用 Grundy、党派用值/温度），再用求和规则合成整体结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;复杂局面&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;分解成独立分量&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{分量是公平游戏?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[&quot;算 Grundy 值&lt;br/&gt;整体异或&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[&quot;算 CGT 值/温度&lt;br/&gt;群加法, 热者优先&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;合成: 判胜负 / 算目数&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"复杂局面\"] --&gt; B[\"分解成独立分量\"]\n  B --&gt; C{分量是公平游戏?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[\"算 Grundy 值&lt;br/&gt;整体异或\"]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[\"算 CGT 值/温度&lt;br/&gt;群加法, 热者优先\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"合成: 判胜负 / 算目数\"]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><p>下表把本篇涉及的游戏按工具归类，便于对照前几章。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>游戏</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>主用工具</th>\n<th>主讲出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>围棋官子</td>\n<td>党派</td>\n<td>温度、均值</td>\n<td><a href=\"../partisan/temperature-theory\">温度与热博弈</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Domineering</td>\n<td>党派</td>\n<td>值、温度</td>\n<td><a href=\"../partisan/game-sums\">游戏的和与值</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hackenbush</td>\n<td>公平/党派</td>\n<td>值、超现实数</td>\n<td><a href=\"../partisan/surreal-numbers\">超现实数</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wythoff</td>\n<td>公平</td>\n<td>Grundy、Beatty 序列</td>\n<td><a href=\"../impartial/grundy-numbers\">Grundy 数</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减法/取子游戏</td>\n<td>公平</td>\n<td>Grundy 周期</td>\n<td><a href=\"../impartial/grundy-numbers\">Grundy 数</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dots-and-Boxes</td>\n<td>特殊</td>\n<td>长链法则、nimber</td>\n<td><a href=\"../impartial/nim-game\">Nim 与异或</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"围棋官子-cgt-最耀眼的战场\">围棋官子：CGT 最耀眼的战场</h2><p>围棋终局天然满足 CGT 的分解前提：棋盘裂成若干互不影响的局部，每个局部值几目、也各有先手价值。Berlekamp 与 Wolfe 在《Mathematical Go》里把每个局部算成 CGT 值（常是形如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a\\mid b\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 的热游戏），按 <a href=\"../partisan/temperature-theory\">温度与热博弈</a> 的&quot;热者优先&quot;依次落子，能精确算出双方最优下的最终目数差，精度常胜过职业棋手直觉。经典的&quot;一目半&quot;官子难题——直觉上无所谓、实则决定胜负——正是靠温度图算出唯一正解。这是 CGT 少有的、结论能被顶尖人类专家验证并叹服的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wythoff-游戏与-beatty-序列\">Wythoff 游戏与 Beatty 序列</h2><p>Wythoff 游戏是 Nim 的一个漂亮变体：两堆石子，每次要么从一堆取任意正数（如 Nim），要么<strong>同时从两堆取相同数量</strong>。它的 P 位置出人意料地与黄金比例相连。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi=\\tfrac{1+\\sqrt5}2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.383em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.399em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9128em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">5</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8728em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1272em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 P 位置恰是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\lfloor n\\varphi\\rfloor,\\ \\lfloor n\\varphi^2\\rfloor),\\quad n=0,1,2,\\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0),(1,2),(3,5),(4,7),(6,10),\\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>——由两条互补的 Beatty 序列给出。这个游戏展示了 <a href=\"../impartial/grundy-numbers\">Grundy 数</a> 之外，公平游戏的胜负结构还能与数论深处（黄金比、连分数）相连，与 <a href=\"../../number-theory/congruence-modular/modular-arithmetic\">模运算</a> 里的整数结构遥相呼应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"减法游戏与取子游戏的周期\">减法游戏与取子游戏的周期</h2><p>一大类实战谜题是减法游戏的变形：给定允许取的数量集合，问某堆数的胜负。它们的 Grundy 序列几乎总是最终周期（见 <a href=\"../impartial/grundy-numbers\">Grundy 数</a>），所以再大的堆都能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 判定。例如&quot;每次取 1 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 颗&quot;的取子游戏，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{G}(n)=n\\bmod(k+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0593em;\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，P 位置是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(k+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的倍数——这就是著名的&quot;报数游戏必胜法&quot;（每轮把两人取数补到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）。这类周期性使得 Grundy 分析成为算法竞赛博弈题的主力，其工程化查表见 <a href=\"solving-games\">求解与残局库</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dots-and-boxes-看似公平的陷阱\">Dots-and-Boxes：看似公平的陷阱</h2><p>连线圈格子的 Dots-and-Boxes（点格棋）是最欺骗性的例子：它表面对称像公平游戏，实则藏着&quot;长链博弈&quot;。胜负关键不在多占格子，而在通过<strong>双十字牺牲</strong>（double-cross）控制长链的奇偶。Berlekamp 证明其残局分析可归结到 nimber 与&quot;控制&quot;理论——谁掌握主动权（control）谁获胜，判断准则与 Nim 的奇偶惊人相似，把 <a href=\"../impartial/nim-game\">Nim 与异或</a> 的思想搬到了看似无关的连线游戏上。这也提醒：判断一个游戏是否公平要看走法集合而非棋盘外观（见 <a href=\"../foundations/impartial-vs-partisan\">公平与党派游戏</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hackenbush-数与无穷小的可视化\">Hackenbush：数与无穷小的可视化</h2><p>Hackenbush 把 CGT 的值系统画成了图：一堆从地面长出的彩色边，砍掉一条边后与地面断开的部分全部消失。纯绿边（两人都能砍）是公平游戏，值是 nimber；蓝边（仅 Left）与红边（仅 Right）构成党派游戏。一条蓝边值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、一条红边值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、蓝上叠红可得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tfrac12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>、更长的蓝红交替串能逼出任意二进制分数乃至无穷小——它是 <a href=\"../partisan/surreal-numbers\">超现实数</a> 最直观的教具。用 Hackenbush 手算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tfrac{3}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span></span></span></span></span>，是把党派值理论&quot;看见&quot;的最好方式。这些案例合起来说明：CGT 不是抽象游戏，而是能把真实棋局算到底的显微镜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CGT 实战流程：分解成独立分量 → 各算 Grundy/值/温度 → 按异或或热者优先合成。</li>\n<li>围棋官子是 CGT 最耀眼的应用，温度理论算出的目数与最优官子胜过职业直觉。</li>\n<li>Wythoff 游戏 P 位置由黄金比 Beatty 序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\lfloor n\\varphi\\rfloor,\\lfloor n\\varphi^2\\rfloor)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋)</span></span></span></span></span> 给出，连接数论。</li>\n<li>减法/取子游戏 Grundy 序列最终周期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 判定；报数游戏必胜法即其特例。</li>\n<li>Dots-and-Boxes 看似公平实为长链博弈，靠 nimber 与控制理论；Hackenbush 把数与无穷小可视化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub 工具出处：<a href=\"../impartial/grundy-numbers\">Grundy 数</a>、<a href=\"../partisan/temperature-theory\">温度与热博弈</a>、<a href=\"../partisan/surreal-numbers\">超现实数</a>、<a href=\"../impartial/nim-game\">Nim 与异或</a></li>\n<li>工程化查表与残局库：<a href=\"solving-games\">求解与残局库</a>；边界：<a href=\"cgt-in-practice\">前沿与边界</a></li>\n<li>跨库对照（黄金比与整数结构）：<a href=\"../../number-theory/congruence-modular/modular-arithmetic\">模运算</a>、<a href=\"../../combinatorics/recurrence-generating-functions/catalan-numbers\">Catalan 数与计数</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用（围棋残局/谜题）","id":"应用-围棋残局-谜题"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"围棋官子：CGT 最耀眼的战场","id":"围棋官子-cgt-最耀眼的战场"},{"level":2,"text":"Wythoff 游戏与 Beatty 序列","id":"wythoff-游戏与-beatty-序列"},{"level":2,"text":"减法游戏与取子游戏的周期","id":"减法游戏与取子游戏的周期"},{"level":2,"text":"Dots-and-Boxes：看似公平的陷阱","id":"dots-and-boxes-看似公平的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"Hackenbush：数与无穷小的可视化","id":"hackenbush-数与无穷小的可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"求解与残局库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/practice/solving-games"},"next":{"title":"前沿与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/combinatorial-game-theory/practice/cgt-in-practice"}}